<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freündt</unclear>: Nachparlich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ersůchen</unclear>, Ihr <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">woellet</unclear>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vůorab</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Euere</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">khornhendler</unclear>, so sich diß
